{"about_the_game":"Enter the captivating world of Ink of Fate and help Helena rewrite her destiny! In this intriguing 3D puzzle and narrative adventure video game, you will immerse yourself in the mysteries of books, where the protagonist, Helena, finds herself trapped in a story written by a mysterious author.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/7190a4a410c806f46599ed8f57dd7254.poster.avif?t=1758571117\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/7190a4a410c806f46599ed8f57dd7254.webm?t=1758571117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/7190a4a410c806f46599ed8f57dd7254.mp4?t=1758571117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO CONTENT</h2>This demo offers 17 unique levels to explore, spread across 9 levels in the Old Forest and 8 levels in the Swamp, where you will also face a challenging final boss.<br>Throughout the adventure, you can collect 31 pages of Helena's story, as well as discover hidden black pages that add mystery to each world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/31e010414633899a19f81244f394a173.avif?t=1758571117\" width=670 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore in 360\u00b0 and solve ingenious puzzles using the free camera.<br></li><li>Master the powers of ink to overcome challenges and unlock new paths.<br></li><li>Face 4 types of ink enemies, including the swamp boss: the Salamander.<br></li><li>Collect Helena's book pages and discover the secrets of her story.<br></li><li>Local save system to continue your progress at any time.<br></li><li>Available in English and Spanish, for an experience accessible to more players.<br></li><li>Full compatibility with controller or keyboard and mouse, so you can play however you prefer.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017690?t=1758571117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/946e71a6b1074bfb20591785f5550cc9284ab6a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758571117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/8fcd3a1dbc69b62692e2846ff184cfc6c05f173d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758571117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/8fcd3a1dbc69b62692e2846ff184cfc6c05f173d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758571117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Enter the captivating world of Ink of Fate and help Helena rewrite her destiny! In this intriguing 3D puzzle and narrative adventure video game, you will immerse yourself in the mysteries of books, where the protagonist, Helena, finds herself trapped in a story written by a mysterious author.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/7190a4a410c806f46599ed8f57dd7254.poster.avif?t=1758571117\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/7190a4a410c806f46599ed8f57dd7254.webm?t=1758571117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/7190a4a410c806f46599ed8f57dd7254.mp4?t=1758571117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO CONTENT</h2>This demo offers 17 unique levels to explore, spread across 9 levels in the Old Forest and 8 levels in the Swamp, where you will also face a challenging final boss.<br>Throughout the adventure, you can collect 31 pages of Helena's story, as well as discover hidden black pages that add mystery to each world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/extras/31e010414633899a19f81244f394a173.avif?t=1758571117\" width=670 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore in 360\u00b0 and solve ingenious puzzles using the free camera.<br></li><li>Master the powers of ink to overcome challenges and unlock new paths.<br></li><li>Face 4 types of ink enemies, including the swamp boss: the Salamander.<br></li><li>Collect Helena's book pages and discover the secrets of her story.<br></li><li>Local save system to continue your progress at any time.<br></li><li>Available in English and Spanish, for an experience accessible to more players.<br></li><li>Full compatibility with controller or keyboard and mouse, so you can play however you prefer.</li></ul>","developers":["Cloud Creatures Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2697180","name":"Ink of Fate"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017690/a2fe339a08af92b6c915b2cf66a4334d10fbc94d/header.jpg?t=1758571117","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257194391,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194391/movie480.mp4?t=1758310220","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t